# Comprehensive Standalone Engineering Course Curriculum
## Building Enterprise Multi-Tenant SaaS & Offline-Capabale Edge Platforms (EventOS Architecture)

---

## Course Overview & Prerequisites

This curriculum is an industry-grade, end-to-end engineering syllabus designed to transform an engineering student into a Senior Full-Stack Cloud & Systems Architect capable of building enterprise-scale platforms from scratch. 

Using **EventOS (`conf-platform`)** as the reference production codebase, this course covers every technological layer: **Modern Monorepos, Asynchronous Python 3.13, TypeScript 5, PostgreSQL 16 with Row-Level Security, Async ORM, FastAPI, Pydantic v2, Celery Task Queues, Redis, FFmpeg Media Pipelines, Socket.IO Real-time WebSockets, Next.js 14 App Router, Electron Edge Apps, Bi-directional Offline Sync Engines, Terraform IaC, AWS Infrastructure (ECS/RDS/S3), NGINX, and GitHub Actions CI/CD.**

